OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells through
OL,7,Fthe day. There will be a scattering of
OL,8,Flight showers but some good spells of
OL,9,Fdry weather too.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with a few
OL,12,Fpassing showers this evening, mainly
OL,13,Facross Argyll. Showery rain across
OL,14,FArgyll overnight with freshening
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds. Mainly dry with
OL,16,Fclear periods elsewhere.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,19,Fspells of rain across Argyll. Drier
OL,20,Felsewhere with a few brief showers.
OL,21,FFresh southwesterly wind across Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
