OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Saturday with spells of rain, most
OL,7,Fpersistent across Argyll. Patchy rain
OL,8,Fat first on Sunday then dry. Dry on
OL,9,FMonday.
